{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581370/extras/SX25_comparisongrid_V1_Steam.jpg?t=1741974747\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Get ready for the official 2025 Supercross season with Monster Energy Supercross 25!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the thrill of racing on newly designed tracks that replicate real-world events and compete against the latest roster of professional riders: forge your path in a revamped career featuring intense competitions, rivalries, and strategic choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks to Unreal Engine 5, enjoy a renewed gameplay experience with realistic physics and dynamic track evolution, making every lap unique and challenging. Master the flow with open tutorials, a comprehensive wiki, and Neural Technology riding aids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your experience with advanced editors and share your creations across platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plus, enjoy full crossplay support for global competition in immersive online multiplayer modes regardless of the platform, whether you're competing in casual races or battling for the top spot in ranked leaderboards.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2581370?t=1741974747","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581370/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741974747","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581370/e20210ab04b45fde6d096963e5ce29e9890919e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741974747","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581370/e20210ab04b45fde6d096963e5ce29e9890919e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741974747","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581370/extras/SX25_comparisongrid_V1_Steam.jpg?t=1741974747\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Get ready for the official 2025 Supercross season with Monster Energy Supercross 25!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the thrill of racing on newly designed tracks that replicate real-world events and compete against the latest roster of professional riders: forge your path in a revamped career featuring intense competitions, rivalries, and strategic choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks to Unreal Engine 5, enjoy a renewed gameplay experience with realistic physics and dynamic track evolution, making every lap unique and challenging. Master the flow with open tutorials, a comprehensive wiki, and Neural Technology riding aids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your experience with advanced editors and share your creations across platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plus, enjoy full crossplay support for global competition in immersive online multiplayer modes regardless of the platform, whether you're competing in casual races or battling for the top spot in ranked leaderboards.</p>","developers":["Milestone S.r.l."],"genres":[{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581370/header.jpg?t=1741974747","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Monster Energy Supercross - The Official Video Game 25 \u00a9 2025 Published and Developed by Milestone S.r.l. All